omaster"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:Unnamed Suit 054 mugshot.png|Suit 054\nS2E41 Suits.png\nS2E35 Suit invoke Venomaster.png\nS2E28 Suit 2.png\nS2E41 Suit.png\nS2E42 Suit invokes Shadow Agent.png\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"File:Unnamed Suit 054 mugshot.png|Suit 054\nS2E41 Suits.png\nS2E35 Suit invoke Venomaster.png\nS2E28 Suit 2.png\nS2E41 Suit.png\nS2E42 Suit invokes Shadow Agent.png"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 054 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by Wilder.\n\n== History ==\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n=== Spells ===\n*Augerfrost\n*Poisonfang\n*Raypulse\n*Shadowspeed\n*Thundercut\n\n=== Titans ===\n*Enforcer\n*Gigadrone\n*Shadow Agent (given by Wilder)\n*Venomaster\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:Unnamed Suit 054 mugshot.png|Suit 054\nS2E41 Suits.png\nS2E35 Suit invoke Venomaster.png\nS2E28 Suit 2.png\nS2E41 Suit.png\nS2E42 Suit invokes Shadow Agent.png","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:S2E31 Suit 054.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Brown\n| eyes   = Brown\n| first  = \"[[Doorway to Huntik]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 054''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[Wilder]].\n\n== History ==\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells ===\n*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Poisonfang]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n*[[Shadowspeed]]\n*[[Thundercut]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Titans ===\n*[[Enforcer]]\n*[[Gigadrone]]\n*[[Shadow Agent]] (given by [[Wilder]])\n*[[Venomaster]]\n{{col-end}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:Unnamed Suit 054 mugshot.png|Suit 054\nS2E41 Suits.png\nS2E35 Suit invoke Venomaster.png\nS2E28 Suit 2.png\nS2E41 Suit.png\nS2E42 Suit invokes Shadow Agent.png\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"},{"target_title":"Doorway to Huntik","label":"Doorway to Huntik","target_id":"huntik:page:6959","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Doorway_to_Huntik","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6959"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Wilder","label":"Wilder","target_id":"huntik:page:4467","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Wilder","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4467"},{"target_title":"Augerfrost","label":"Augerfrost","target_id":"huntik:page:2005","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Augerfrost","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2005"},{"target_